Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.02,0:23:40.00,EpTitle,,0,0,0,,第22话 现在开始全都要做!?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.48,0:00:14.56,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,喂？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.81,0:00:15.73,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,朱朱大人
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.23,0:00:17.81,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,什么事 喜多川海梦
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.23,0:00:20.21,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,抱歉突然打电话给你
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.28,0:00:21.19,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,确实很突然呢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.40,0:00:22.59,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,吐槽得真直接
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.65,0:00:23.71,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,朱朱？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.78,0:00:25.71,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,海梦在和朱朱说话吗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.78,0:00:26.99,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,你现在在外面吗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.37,0:00:29.12,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,我正在跟家人逛街
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.33,0:00:30.91,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,原来是外出中啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.62,0:00:35.47,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,我今天以摄影师的身份参加了活动哦
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.54,0:00:36.93,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,你买相机了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.00,0:00:37.64,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.71,0:00:41.92,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,然后啊 下次决定要办「棺」的团拍！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.92,0:00:44.01,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,那个恐怖游戏啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.26,0:00:46.05,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,朱朱大人也喜欢吗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.34,0:00:48.72,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,喜欢的不是我 是心寿
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.10,0:00:51.03,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,因为那孩子喜欢各种恐怖类的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.10,0:00:52.27,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,原来是这样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.81,0:00:55.79,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,然后下礼拜天就要团拍了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.85,0:00:57.25,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,下礼拜天…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.31,0:00:59.08,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,你的服装来得及吗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.15,0:01:01.00,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,是五条新菜要做的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.07,0:01:03.74,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,这次要用现成的服装Cos
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.19,0:01:06.74,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,然后啊 朱朱大人
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.57,0:01:09.45,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,怎样
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.70,0:01:11.91,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,那个团拍啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.16,0:01:15.79,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,其实还少了两个人
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.41,0:01:17.39,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,朱朱大人也一起…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.46,0:01:18.00,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,我不要
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.58,0:01:22.09,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,再怎么说也拒绝得太快了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.30,0:01:25.09,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,我只为了我自己Cosplay
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.34,0:01:27.19,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,没有打算和其他Coser鬼混
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.26,0:01:28.59,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,我之前也有说过才对
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.14,0:01:31.60,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,如果人数不够的话 请去找其他人
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.10,0:01:35.74,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,不行呢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.81,0:01:36.54,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,果然啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.60,0:01:37.98,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,为什么你一脸开心的样子？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.52,0:01:40.56,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,姐姐
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.69,0:01:45.36,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,妈妈说她要先去爸爸那边
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.99,0:01:47.00,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.07,0:01:48.36,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,你刚刚在讲电话吗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.11,0:01:51.07,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,喜多川海梦她打来的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.49,0:01:52.37,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,海梦同学？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.66,0:01:54.97,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,她问我下次要不要参加「棺」的团拍
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.04,0:01:57.51,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,姐姐要参加「棺」的团拍吗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.58,0:01:58.92,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,好棒哦！ 好棒哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.92,0:02:00.77,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,真期待！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.84,0:02:02.88,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,好想看姐姐的「棺」Cosplay
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.21,0:02:05.86,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,米菈 萝洁 克蕾雅
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.92,0:02:08.88,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,艾玛 苏菲亚 夏洛特
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.34,0:02:11.85,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,如果是姐姐的话感觉每个都很适合
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.35,0:02:14.45,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,应该会拍摄用餐的场景吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.51,0:02:16.91,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,那段是绝对不能错过的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.98,0:02:19.52,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,还有过关之后的标题画面也是
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.77,0:02:21.91,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,有好多想看的场景…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.98,0:02:24.29,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,因为是团拍 所以会在摄影棚拍吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.36,0:02:26.00,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,会是怎样的摄影棚呢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.07,0:02:28.55,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,我保证绝对不会打扰到你们的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.61,0:02:31.03,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,我也想在旁边参观
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.28,0:02:32.53,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,我拒绝了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.78,0:02:34.76,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,「烈！！」的时候是为了黑百合的服装
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.83,0:02:36.70,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,还有节省摄影棚的费用
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.16,0:02:38.26,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,虽然是还不错
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.33,0:02:39.91,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,但我不会再参加团拍了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.37,0:02:43.14,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,就算是五条新菜制作的服装
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.21,0:02:45.04,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,如果不是魔法少女的话 我…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.55,0:02:53.60,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,也是呢…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.60,0:02:57.03,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,我还以为能看到「棺」的Cos
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.10,0:02:59.06,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,是我误会了…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.39,0:03:02.81,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,对不起…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.21,0:03:27.09,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,喂 喜多川海梦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.59,0:03:34.16,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\bord1\blur4\c&HA289EE&\3c&HFFFFFF&}アオイハル 続いてく未来
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.16,0:03:35.62,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\bord1\blur4\c&HA289EE&\3c&HFFFFFF&}なんでもない なんでもない 今日も
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.62,0:03:37.10,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\bord1\blur4\c&HA289EE&\3c&HFFFFFF&}キミとなら Make it fun
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.45,0:03:54.47,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\bord1\blur4\c&HA289EE&\3c&HFFFFFF&}踊る風にさそわれた 坂道の向こうがわに
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.54,0:04:00.21,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\bord1\blur4\c&HA289EE&\3c&HFFFFFF&}こまでも広がる青瞳を奪われて
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.59,0:04:04.86,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\bord1\blur4\c&HA289EE&\3c&HFFFFFF&}音立てる ときめきの予感
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.92,0:04:10.76,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\bord1\blur4\c&HA289EE&\3c&HFFFFFF&}真っ白な秘めた気持ちが 色づいてゆく
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.39,0:04:13.24,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\bord1\blur4\c&HA289EE&\3c&HFFFFFF&}さぁ 行こう
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.31,0:04:18.66,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\bord1\blur4\c&HA289EE&\3c&HFFFFFF&}キミと 紬いでく未来
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.73,0:04:24.25,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\bord1\blur4\c&HA289EE&\3c&HFFFFFF&}今はまだ手探りで迷っても
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.32,0:04:29.55,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\bord1\blur4\c&HA289EE&\3c&HFFFFFF&}放物線描き出す光
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.61,0:04:35.64,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\bord1\blur4\c&HA289EE&\3c&HFFFFFF&}七色の明日が呼んでる
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.70,0:04:38.43,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\bord1\blur4\c&HA289EE&\3c&HFFFFFF&}道しるべ なくたって
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.50,0:04:41.18,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\bord1\blur4\c&HA289EE&\3c&HFFFFFF&}不安なら わけあって
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.25,0:04:43.94,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\bord1\blur4\c&HA289EE&\3c&HFFFFFF&}キミがいる いつだって
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.00,0:04:46.76,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\bord1\blur4\c&HA289EE&\3c&HFFFFFF&}ほら笑って Hi-Five
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.59,0:03:34.16,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\bord1\blur4\c&HA289EE&\3c&HFFFFFF&}稚嫩的青春 延续向未来
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.16,0:03:35.62,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\bord1\blur4\c&HA289EE&\3c&HFFFFFF&}平凡无奇 平凡无奇 今天也一样
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.62,0:03:37.10,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\bord1\blur4\c&HA289EE&\3c&HFFFFFF&}和你在一起 Make it fun
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.45,0:03:54.47,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\bord1\blur4\c&HA289EE&\3c&HFFFFFF&}受到起舞的风邀请 去到坡道另一边
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.54,0:04:00.21,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\bord1\blur4\c&HA289EE&\3c&HFFFFFF&}无边无际的蓝 吸引了我的双眼
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.59,0:04:04.86,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\bord1\blur4\c&HA289EE&\3c&HFFFFFF&}发出声响的 悸动预感
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.92,0:04:10.76,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\bord1\blur4\c&HA289EE&\3c&HFFFFFF&}隐藏的纯白心情 逐渐染上色彩
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.39,0:04:13.24,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\bord1\blur4\c&HA289EE&\3c&HFFFFFF&}来吧 出发吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.31,0:04:18.66,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\bord1\blur4\c&HA289EE&\3c&HFFFFFF&}与你 一起编织 未来
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.73,0:04:24.25,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\bord1\blur4\c&HA289EE&\3c&HFFFFFF&}就算现在还在摸索 还在迷惘
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.32,0:04:29.55,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\bord1\blur4\c&HA289EE&\3c&HFFFFFF&}描绘出 抛物线的光芒
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.61,0:04:35.64,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\bord1\blur4\c&HA289EE&\3c&HFFFFFF&}七彩的明天 正在呼唤我们
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.70,0:04:38.43,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\bord1\blur4\c&HA289EE&\3c&HFFFFFF&}即使没有 路标
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.50,0:04:41.18,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\bord1\blur4\c&HA289EE&\3c&HFFFFFF&}有不安 就一起分担
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.25,0:04:43.94,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\bord1\blur4\c&HA289EE&\3c&HFFFFFF&}有你在 永远
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.00,0:04:46.76,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\bord1\blur4\c&HA289EE&\3c&HFFFFFF&}来 笑一个吧 Hi-Five
